==== brackets-alone
<span class="chcklst-box fa fa-square-o" data-chk-src="0:0"></span> <span class="chcklst-box fa fa-square-o" data-chk-src="0:1"></span> [/] [[ ]] [ b] [/ b] [b ] [=]
==== unterminated-openers
[b [center [div=x
==== opener-without-name-end
[bold]x[/bold] [bx]y[/bx] [b1]z[/b1]
==== equals-without-value
<span class="bbcode-b">x</span> y <div>z</div>
==== space-before-equals
<div style="color:red">x</div>
<span style="color: red">y</span>
==== only-closes
[/b][/i][/center][/div]
==== only-opens
[b][i][center][div=x]
==== double-brackets
[<span class="bbcode-b">]x[</span>]
==== interleaved
<span class="bbcode-b"><span class="bbcode-i"><span class="bbcode-u">x</span></span></span>yz
==== interleaved-blocks
<div class="bb-center"><div style="a">x</div></div>
y
==== close-before-open
[/b]x[b]
==== unclosed-in-closed
<span class="bbcode-b">a [i]b c</span>
